  "duration_s": 244.552993,
  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "这酒怎么喝到最后还有半瓶，半瓶留着下次喝，说明咱俩的局还没完。酒喝干了是散场，剩半瓶续举，您下回还得来都吃到这个点儿了，你怎么还没敬我一杯敬您的人排着队呢？我最后一个敬前面的酒，您喝的是场面。我这杯您喝的是收尾，代表今天的事儿圆满，你怎么就喝这点儿养鱼呢？我得留着量，万一您喝到位了，总得有个清醒的人负责。掏您家门钥匙吧。这酒开了，你不先给我倒，先倒的是客，后倒的是主。您是今天的主人，最后一杯满上代表压轴，全桌的福气都沉淀在您杯底。哎呀，我都老了，不中用了。哎，领导，您可千万别这么说，我们论能力、论经验论、资历都不如您，这样的老前辈还得靠您带着我们进步啊。你这敬酒的顺序是不是不对？怎么先敬别人，先把流程走完，最后踏踏实实坐下来，陪您慢慢喝。好的，留到最后。我看看你这丫头最近是越来越精神了啊，那是因为沾了领导，您的光跟着您干事儿，气色当然不会差了。啊哈瞧你最近表现的不错啊，看来我的这个位置马上就该你坐了，我得提前敬你一杯。听您的意思，领导也是高升了呀，我也提前敬领导一杯。哈哈哈哈哈你今天话怎么这么少？再听您说，酒桌上，您讲东西比开会时还有料，我舍不得打断你怎么菜还没上齐，你就结账了。先结账是表明态度，这顿饭我请定了，后面再加菜。您随便点，没有心理负担，吃了才尽兴。你这衣服穿了好几年了吧，穿着舒服，跟您共事久了，人也实在了不讲究那些虚的啊。哈哈哈哈，我这字儿写的一般，你别为了哄我乱夸字，我确实不懂，但你一握笔，全屋都安静了。这个我懂你这人脾气挺好，没见你发过火，发火解决不了问题，您在前面顶着压力，我在后面添乱不合适。哈哈哈哈哈。小王站，我旁边不怕把你照老了站您旁边哪会显老，只会显得我年纪轻轻站的挺对。哈哈哈哈哈哈哈，怎么我来迟了，你也不打个电话催催催您是给您压力，等您是给您尊重您来迟肯定有原因，我等的就是信任到了，就是圆满。哈哈哈，家里没什么好茶，你就凑合喝吧茶叶好不好？得看怎么标价。您亲手倒的这杯，只讲情分，不讲价这鱼怎么点的这么赞。前面大鱼大肉最后来一口清淡的漱漱口。就像您听完汇报，最后来一句总结，清清爽爽，散会好好啊。好，梨，我就先收下了，但事儿能不能办成，我可不敢打包票啊。领导，您说笑了，这事儿能成是您的加持，不能成的话就是我的造化，无论结果如何，都得感谢。领导您的提携，你一开口就让人喜欢你，你是怎么做到的？因为我一直在看这本对答如流，这个世界上谁都不会拒绝，那些会说话，会来事儿的人。假如你不爱说话，不爱争辩，也不爱出门，甚至恐惧社交，推荐你读完这本对答如流，让你轻松摆平各种社交场合。你每天就看两页，每一个场景慢慢练，你就会变成一个会说话、懂交际的人。在这本书里，有一句话，我特别欣赏，他，写的是面对别人夸你优秀时，你可以回，那是不优秀点，怎么能和你做朋友呢？当有人说你真聪明，你就回近朱者赤，和你在一起啊，熏都熏出来了当领导跟你说辛苦了，你就回领导，这都是我应该做的。强将手下吴若冰，我怎么能给您丢脸呢？当我看到这段的时候，这个真是让我欲解心开啊。每一句都很有意思，就是手把手教我们在不同的场景之下，应该怎么说？书籍的内容和我现在展示的是一模一样的，你就放心的拿回去看，就是一句一句的教你，让你轻松摆平各种社交场合，但凡学会三分，你就能把人际关系拿捏的死死的。这本书真的可以帮助到大家。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3299545e93c3d39e_s00001",
      "start_ms": 110,
      "end_ms": 2010,
      "text": "这酒怎么喝到最后还有半瓶，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3299545e93c3d39e_s00002",
      "start_ms": 2350,
      "end_ms": 3450,
      "text": "半瓶留着下次喝，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3299545e93c3d39e_s00003",
      "start_ms": 3550,
      "end_ms": 5110,
      "text": "说明咱俩的局还没完。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3299545e93c3d39e_s00004",
      "start_ms": 5290,
      "end_ms": 6490,
      "text": "酒喝干了是散场，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3299545e93c3d39e_s00005",
      "start_ms": 6530,
      "end_ms": 7410,
      "text": "剩半瓶续举，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3299545e93c3d39e_s00006",
      "start_ms": 7590,
      "end_ms": 11290,
      "text": "您下回还得来都吃到这个点儿了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3299545e93c3d39e_s00007",
      "start_ms": 11290,
      "end_ms": 13970,
      "text": "你怎么还没敬我一杯敬您的人排着队呢？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3299545e93c3d39e_s00008",
      "start_ms": 13970,
      "end_ms": 15250,
      "text": "我最后一个敬前面的酒，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3299545e93c3d39e_s00009",
      "start_ms": 15250,
      "end_ms": 16010,
      "text": "您喝的是场面。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3299545e93c3d39e_s00010",
      "start_ms": 16010,
      "end_ms": 17150,
      "text": "我这杯您喝的是收尾，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3299545e93c3d39e_s00011",
      "start_ms": 17150,
      "end_ms": 18290,
      "text": "代表今天的事儿圆满，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3299545e93c3d39e_s00012",
      "start_ms": 20210,
      "end_ms": 22290,
      "text": "你怎么就喝这点儿养鱼呢？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3299545e93c3d39e_s00013",
      "start_ms": 22730,
      "end_ms": 23550,
      "text": "我得留着量，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3299545e93c3d39e_s00014",
      "start_ms": 23650,
      "end_ms": 24710,
      "text": "万一您喝到位了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3299545e93c3d39e_s00015",
      "start_ms": 24710,
      "end_ms": 25910,
      "text": "总得有个清醒的人负责。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3299545e93c3d39e_s00016",
      "start_ms": 25910,
      "end_ms": 28375,
      "text": "掏您家门钥匙吧。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3299545e93c3d39e_s00017",
      "start_ms": 30180,
      "end_ms": 30960,
      "text": "这酒开了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3299545e93c3d39e_s00018",
      "start_ms": 31040,
      "end_ms": 31900,
      "text": "你不先给我倒，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3299545e93c3d39e_s00019",
      "start_ms": 32460,
      "end_ms": 33260,
      "text": "先倒的是客，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3299545e93c3d39e_s00020",
      "start_ms": 33260,
      "end_ms": 34000,
      "text": "后倒的是主。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3299545e93c3d39e_s00021",
      "start_ms": 34040,
      "end_ms": 34960,
      "text": "您是今天的主人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3299545e93c3d39e_s00022",
      "start_ms": 34980,
      "end_ms": 36460,
      "text": "最后一杯满上代表压轴，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3299545e93c3d39e_s00023",
      "start_ms": 36540,
      "end_ms": 38300,
      "text": "全桌的福气都沉淀在您杯底。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3299545e93c3d39e_s00024",
      "start_ms": 39900,
      "end_ms": 40340,
      "text": "哎呀，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3299545e93c3d39e_s00025",
      "start_ms": 40640,
      "end_ms": 41480,
      "text": "我都老了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3299545e93c3d39e_s00026",
      "start_ms": 41720,
      "end_ms": 42620,
      "text": "不中用了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3299545e93c3d39e_s00027",
      "start_ms": 42820,
      "end_ms": 43060,
      "text": "哎，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3299545e93c3d39e_s00028",
      "start_ms": 43080,
      "end_ms": 43420,
      "text": "领导，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3299545e93c3d39e_s00029",
      "start_ms": 43420,
      "end_ms": 44480,
      "text": "您可千万别这么说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3299545e93c3d39e_s00030",
      "start_ms": 44640,
      "end_ms": 46680,
      "text": "我们论能力、论经验论、资历都不如您，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3299545e93c3d39e_s00031",
      "start_ms": 46680,
      "end_ms": 49100,
      "text": "这样的老前辈还得靠您带着我们进步啊。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3299545e93c3d39e_s00032",
      "start_ms": 50060,
      "end_ms": 51840,
      "text": "你这敬酒的顺序是不是不对？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3299545e93c3d39e_s00033",
      "start_ms": 52120,
      "end_ms": 53100,
      "text": "怎么先敬别人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3299545e93c3d39e_s00034",
      "start_ms": 53220,
      "end_ms": 54240,
      "text": "先把流程走完，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3299545e93c3d39e_s00035",
      "start_ms": 54360,
      "end_ms": 55640,
      "text": "最后踏踏实实坐下来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3299545e93c3d39e_s00036",
      "start_ms": 55640,
      "end_ms": 56340,
      "text": "陪您慢慢喝。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3299545e93c3d39e_s00037",
      "start_ms": 56480,
      "end_ms": 56760,
      "text": "好的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3299545e93c3d39e_s00038",
      "start_ms": 56760,
      "end_ms": 57300,
      "text": "留到最后。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3299545e93c3d39e_s00039",
      "start_ms": 59600,
      "end_ms": 63465,
      "text": "我看看你这丫头最近是越来越精神了啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3299545e93c3d39e_s00040",
      "start_ms": 63810,
      "end_ms": 64750,
      "text": "那是因为沾了领导，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3299545e93c3d39e_s00041",
      "start_ms": 64750,
      "end_ms": 66310,
      "text": "您的光跟着您干事儿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3299545e93c3d39e_s00042",
      "start_ms": 66310,
      "end_ms": 67445,
      "text": "气色当然不会差了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3299545e93c3d39e_s00043",
      "start_ms": 67620,
      "end_ms": 71235,
      "text": "啊哈瞧你最近表现的不错啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3299545e93c3d39e_s00044",
      "start_ms": 71590,
      "end_ms": 73775,
      "text": "看来我的这个位置马上就该你坐了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3299545e93c3d39e_s00045",
      "start_ms": 73960,
      "end_ms": 75220,
      "text": "我得提前敬你一杯。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3299545e93c3d39e_s00046",
      "start_ms": 75320,
      "end_ms": 76080,
      "text": "听您的意思，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3299545e93c3d39e_s00047",
      "start_ms": 76100,
      "end_ms": 77100,
      "text": "领导也是高升了呀，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3299545e93c3d39e_s00048",
      "start_ms": 77100,
      "end_ms": 78285,
      "text": "我也提前敬领导一杯。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3299545e93c3d39e_s00049",
      "start_ms": 78590,
      "end_ms": 81005,
      "text": "哈哈哈哈哈你今天话怎么这么少？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3299545e93c3d39e_s00050",
      "start_ms": 81280,
      "end_ms": 81980,
      "text": "再听您说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3299545e93c3d39e_s00051",
      "start_ms": 82180,
      "end_ms": 82640,
      "text": "酒桌上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3299545e93c3d39e_s00052",
      "start_ms": 82640,
      "end_ms": 84435,
      "text": "您讲东西比开会时还有料，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3299545e93c3d39e_s00053",
      "start_ms": 84660,
      "end_ms": 89070,
      "text": "我舍不得打断你怎么菜还没上齐，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3299545e93c3d39e_s00054",
      "start_ms": 89070,
      "end_ms": 89915,
      "text": "你就结账了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3299545e93c3d39e_s00055",
      "start_ms": 90370,
      "end_ms": 91875,
      "text": "先结账是表明态度，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3299545e93c3d39e_s00056",
      "start_ms": 92060,
      "end_ms": 93075,
      "text": "这顿饭我请定了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3299545e93c3d39e_s00057",
      "start_ms": 93330,
      "end_ms": 94010,
      "text": "后面再加菜。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3299545e93c3d39e_s00058",
      "start_ms": 94010,
      "end_ms": 94685,
      "text": "您随便点，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3299545e93c3d39e_s00059",
      "start_ms": 94900,
      "end_ms": 95700,
      "text": "没有心理负担，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3299545e93c3d39e_s00060",
      "start_ms": 95700,
      "end_ms": 96615,
      "text": "吃了才尽兴。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3299545e93c3d39e_s00061",
      "start_ms": 97810,
      "end_ms": 99815,
      "text": "你这衣服穿了好几年了吧，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3299545e93c3d39e_s00062",
      "start_ms": 100840,
      "end_ms": 101665,
      "text": "穿着舒服，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3299545e93c3d39e_s00063",
      "start_ms": 102060,
      "end_ms": 102960,
      "text": "跟您共事久了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3299545e93c3d39e_s00064",
      "start_ms": 102960,
      "end_ms": 106085,
      "text": "人也实在了不讲究那些虚的啊。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3299545e93c3d39e_s00065",
      "start_ms": 106250,
      "end_ms": 106915,
      "text": "哈哈哈哈，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3299545e93c3d39e_s00066",
      "start_ms": 107860,
      "end_ms": 109155,
      "text": "我这字儿写的一般，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3299545e93c3d39e_s00067",
      "start_ms": 109510,
      "end_ms": 111450,
      "text": "你别为了哄我乱夸字，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3299545e93c3d39e_s00068",
      "start_ms": 111450,
      "end_ms": 112225,
      "text": "我确实不懂，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3299545e93c3d39e_s00069",
      "start_ms": 112560,
      "end_ms": 113380,
      "text": "但你一握笔，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3299545e93c3d39e_s00070",
      "start_ms": 113380,
      "end_ms": 114300,
      "text": "全屋都安静了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3299545e93c3d39e_s00071",
      "start_ms": 114300,
      "end_ms": 118865,
      "text": "这个我懂你这人脾气挺好，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3299545e93c3d39e_s00072",
      "start_ms": 119390,
      "end_ms": 120515,
      "text": "没见你发过火，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3299545e93c3d39e_s00073",
      "start_ms": 120940,
      "end_ms": 122265,
      "text": "发火解决不了问题，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3299545e93c3d39e_s00074",
      "start_ms": 122730,
      "end_ms": 123970,
      "text": "您在前面顶着压力，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3299545e93c3d39e_s00075",
      "start_ms": 123970,
      "end_ms": 125575,
      "text": "我在后面添乱不合适。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3299545e93c3d39e_s00076",
      "start_ms": 126220,
      "end_ms": 127225,
      "text": "哈哈哈哈哈。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3299545e93c3d39e_s00077",
      "start_ms": 127470,
      "end_ms": 127990,
      "text": "小王站，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3299545e93c3d39e_s00078",
      "start_ms": 127990,
      "end_ms": 131945,
      "text": "我旁边不怕把你照老了站您旁边哪会显老，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3299545e93c3d39e_s00079",
      "start_ms": 132280,
      "end_ms": 134175,
      "text": "只会显得我年纪轻轻站的挺对。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3299545e93c3d39e_s00080",
      "start_ms": 134600,
      "end_ms": 135865,
      "text": "哈哈哈哈哈哈哈，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3299545e93c3d39e_s00081",
      "start_ms": 136320,
      "end_ms": 137415,
      "text": "怎么我来迟了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3299545e93c3d39e_s00082",
      "start_ms": 137750,
      "end_ms": 140250,
      "text": "你也不打个电话催催催您是给您压力，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3299545e93c3d39e_s00083",
      "start_ms": 140350,
      "end_ms": 142490,
      "text": "等您是给您尊重您来迟肯定有原因，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3299545e93c3d39e_s00084",
      "start_ms": 142690,
      "end_ms": 144070,
      "text": "我等的就是信任到了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3299545e93c3d39e_s00085",
      "start_ms": 144070,
      "end_ms": 144715,
      "text": "就是圆满。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3299545e93c3d39e_s00086",
      "start_ms": 145330,
      "end_ms": 145915,
      "text": "哈哈哈，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3299545e93c3d39e_s00087",
      "start_ms": 146370,
      "end_ms": 147510,
      "text": "家里没什么好茶，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3299545e93c3d39e_s00088",
      "start_ms": 147790,
      "end_ms": 150130,
      "text": "你就凑合喝吧茶叶好不好？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3299545e93c3d39e_s00089",
      "start_ms": 150210,
      "end_ms": 151225,
      "text": "得看怎么标价。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3299545e93c3d39e_s00090",
      "start_ms": 151570,
      "end_ms": 152710,
      "text": "您亲手倒的这杯，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3299545e93c3d39e_s00091",
      "start_ms": 152850,
      "end_ms": 153530,
      "text": "只讲情分，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3299545e93c3d39e_s00092",
      "start_ms": 153530,
      "end_ms": 156020,
      "text": "不讲价这鱼怎么点的这么赞。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3299545e93c3d39e_s00093",
      "start_ms": 156020,
      "end_ms": 158500,
      "text": "前面大鱼大肉最后来一口清淡的漱漱口。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3299545e93c3d39e_s00094",
      "start_ms": 158640,
      "end_ms": 159880,
      "text": "就像您听完汇报，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3299545e93c3d39e_s00095",
      "start_ms": 159900,
      "end_ms": 160820,
      "text": "最后来一句总结，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3299545e93c3d39e_s00096",
      "start_ms": 160940,
      "end_ms": 161560,
      "text": "清清爽爽，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3299545e93c3d39e_s00097",
      "start_ms": 161560,
      "end_ms": 163000,
      "text": "散会好好啊。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3299545e93c3d39e_s00098",
      "start_ms": 163000,
      "end_ms": 163240,
      "text": "好，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3299545e93c3d39e_s00099",
      "start_ms": 163370,
      "end_ms": 163490,
      "text": "梨，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3299545e93c3d39e_s00100",
      "start_ms": 163490,
      "end_ms": 164295,
      "text": "我就先收下了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3299545e93c3d39e_s00101",
      "start_ms": 164520,
      "end_ms": 165540,
      "text": "但事儿能不能办成，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3299545e93c3d39e_s00102",
      "start_ms": 165540,
      "end_ms": 166680,
      "text": "我可不敢打包票啊。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3299545e93c3d39e_s00103",
      "start_ms": 166680,
      "end_ms": 166880,
      "text": "领导，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3299545e93c3d39e_s00104",
      "start_ms": 166880,
      "end_ms": 167565,
      "text": "您说笑了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3299545e93c3d39e_s00105",
      "start_ms": 167820,
      "end_ms": 169060,
      "text": "这事儿能成是您的加持，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3299545e93c3d39e_s00106",
      "start_ms": 169100,
      "end_ms": 170360,
      "text": "不能成的话就是我的造化，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3299545e93c3d39e_s00107",
      "start_ms": 170460,
      "end_ms": 171240,
      "text": "无论结果如何，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3299545e93c3d39e_s00108",
      "start_ms": 171240,
      "end_ms": 171820,
      "text": "都得感谢。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3299545e93c3d39e_s00109",
      "start_ms": 171820,
      "end_ms": 172660,
      "text": "领导您的提携，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3299545e93c3d39e_s00110",
      "start_ms": 173660,
      "end_ms": 175095,
      "text": "你一开口就让人喜欢你，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3299545e93c3d39e_s00111",
      "start_ms": 175350,
      "end_ms": 176295,
      "text": "你是怎么做到的？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3299545e93c3d39e_s00112",
      "start_ms": 176680,
      "end_ms": 178760,
      "text": "因为我一直在看这本对答如流，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3299545e93c3d39e_s00113",
      "start_ms": 179060,
      "end_ms": 180840,
      "text": "这个世界上谁都不会拒绝，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3299545e93c3d39e_s00114",
      "start_ms": 180920,
      "end_ms": 181800,
      "text": "那些会说话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3299545e93c3d39e_s00115",
      "start_ms": 181900,
      "end_ms": 182780,
      "text": "会来事儿的人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3299545e93c3d39e_s00116",
      "start_ms": 182860,
      "end_ms": 183940,
      "text": "假如你不爱说话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3299545e93c3d39e_s00117",
      "start_ms": 184080,
      "end_ms": 184840,
      "text": "不爱争辩，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3299545e93c3d39e_s00118",
      "start_ms": 184920,
      "end_ms": 185800,
      "text": "也不爱出门，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3299545e93c3d39e_s00119",
      "start_ms": 185960,
      "end_ms": 187120,
      "text": "甚至恐惧社交，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3299545e93c3d39e_s00120",
      "start_ms": 187500,
      "end_ms": 189500,
      "text": "推荐你读完这本对答如流，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3299545e93c3d39e_s00121",
      "start_ms": 189660,
      "end_ms": 191925,
      "text": "让你轻松摆平各种社交场合。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3299545e93c3d39e_s00122",
      "start_ms": 192250,
      "end_ms": 193410,
      "text": "你每天就看两页，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3299545e93c3d39e_s00123",
      "start_ms": 193550,
      "end_ms": 194955,
      "text": "每一个场景慢慢练，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3299545e93c3d39e_s00124",
      "start_ms": 195270,
      "end_ms": 197830,
      "text": "你就会变成一个会说话、懂交际的人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3299545e93c3d39e_s00125",
      "start_ms": 197990,
      "end_ms": 198750,
      "text": "在这本书里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3299545e93c3d39e_s00126",
      "start_ms": 198750,
      "end_ms": 199330,
      "text": "有一句话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3299545e93c3d39e_s00127",
      "start_ms": 199390,
      "end_ms": 200285,
      "text": "我特别欣赏，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3299545e93c3d39e_s00128",
      "start_ms": 200600,
      "end_ms": 200780,
      "text": "他，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3299545e93c3d39e_s00129",
      "start_ms": 200780,
      "end_ms": 202825,
      "text": "写的是面对别人夸你优秀时，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3299545e93c3d39e_s00130",
      "start_ms": 203070,
      "end_ms": 203755,
      "text": "你可以回，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3299545e93c3d39e_s00131",
      "start_ms": 204220,
      "end_ms": 205160,
      "text": "那是不优秀点，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3299545e93c3d39e_s00132",
      "start_ms": 205240,
      "end_ms": 206525,
      "text": "怎么能和你做朋友呢？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3299545e93c3d39e_s00133",
      "start_ms": 206900,
      "end_ms": 208580,
      "text": "当有人说你真聪明，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3299545e93c3d39e_s00134",
      "start_ms": 208640,
      "end_ms": 210395,
      "text": "你就回近朱者赤，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3299545e93c3d39e_s00135",
      "start_ms": 210670,
      "end_ms": 211610,
      "text": "和你在一起啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3299545e93c3d39e_s00136",
      "start_ms": 211730,
      "end_ms": 214730,
      "text": "熏都熏出来了当领导跟你说辛苦了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3299545e93c3d39e_s00137",
      "start_ms": 214810,
      "end_ms": 216045,
      "text": "你就回领导，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3299545e93c3d39e_s00138",
      "start_ms": 216280,
      "end_ms": 217515,
      "text": "这都是我应该做的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3299545e93c3d39e_s00139",
      "start_ms": 217780,
      "end_ms": 219160,
      "text": "强将手下吴若冰，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3299545e93c3d39e_s00140",
      "start_ms": 219400,
      "end_ms": 220885,
      "text": "我怎么能给您丢脸呢？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3299545e93c3d39e_s00141",
      "start_ms": 221300,
      "end_ms": 222620,
      "text": "当我看到这段的时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3299545e93c3d39e_s00142",
      "start_ms": 222620,
      "end_ms": 224435,
      "text": "这个真是让我欲解心开啊。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3299545e93c3d39e_s00143",
      "start_ms": 224790,
      "end_ms": 226055,
      "text": "每一句都很有意思，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3299545e93c3d39e_s00144",
      "start_ms": 226340,
      "end_ms": 228760,
      "text": "就是手把手教我们在不同的场景之下，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3299545e93c3d39e_s00145",
      "start_ms": 228760,
      "end_ms": 229500,
      "text": "应该怎么说？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3299545e93c3d39e_s00146",
      "start_ms": 229620,
      "end_ms": 232285,
      "text": "书籍的内容和我现在展示的是一模一样的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3299545e93c3d39e_s00147",
      "start_ms": 232550,
      "end_ms": 233870,
      "text": "你就放心的拿回去看，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3299545e93c3d39e_s00148",
      "start_ms": 234210,
      "end_ms": 235650,
      "text": "就是一句一句的教你，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3299545e93c3d39e_s00149",
      "start_ms": 235870,
      "end_ms": 238355,
      "text": "让你轻松摆平各种社交场合，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3299545e93c3d39e_s00150",
      "start_ms": 238690,
      "end_ms": 239730,
      "text": "但凡学会三分，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3299545e93c3d39e_s00151",
      "start_ms": 239970,
      "end_ms": 242325,
      "text": "你就能把人际关系拿捏的死死的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_3299545e93c3d39e_s00152",
      "start_ms": 242750,
      "end_ms": 244435,
      "text": "这本书真的可以帮助到大家。"
    }
  ],
